    <credit-type>subtitle</credit-type>
    <credit-words default-x="725" default-y="1600" justify="center" valign="top" font-family="Times New Roman" font-size="11" font-weight="normal">GYC 2019 Theme Song

Jonathan, the prince, said to his young armor-bearer, “Come, let us go!
For nothing can hinder the Lord from saving,
whether by many or by few.”
1 Samuel 14:6</credit-words>
